  <item>
    <title>Vol.07:从锅包肉到巧克力排骨炖橙汁豆角</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68cf7f552c82c9dcca6ad972</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68cf7f552c82c9dcca6ad972</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 04:45:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>禁烟大使——鑫宇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>抓周馋鬼——大雄</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>语言达人——王好</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 锅包肉派系之争（蓝莓锅包肉是什么！？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 烤冷面大赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a> 天津是个包容性很强的城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 冰-糖葫芦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 冰棍和小卖铺往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 莜面栲栳栳（里面有谁姥？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 韩国的朝鲜冷面（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">11:16</a> 延吉拌饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 邪恶姥姥的婆婆丁馄饨vs山中蘑菇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 清明野蒜配疙瘩汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 烤饼夹串or烤猪蹄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a> 浙江菜好寡淡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 学校食堂1.0（高中食堂也能吃这么好！？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 王好的灰产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 学校趣闻1.0</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 刘文祥麻辣烫（什么蚊香？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 抚顺麻辣拌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> 学校食堂2.0（你们食堂怎么这么好吃😋）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> 天津炸串，刨冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 家家红罐头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 杏仁腐，木莲豆腐，苏式绿豆汤（大家都和薄荷是好朋友）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> 东北冰糕，早市，碴条，蛋堡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 语言达人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> 早点，早点，早点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a> 快抖b</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> 校门口路边摊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2836">47:16</a> 你们也吃生蒜吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">48:07</a> 火亢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a> 农村大席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 抓周馋鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3503">58:23</a> 红肠 干肠 香肠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3590">59:50</a> 无骨鸡爪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3691">61:31</a> 小学时期的疫病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3869">64:29</a> 兔子抽烟（抽烟不好哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">65:48</a> 烟糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3988">66:28</a> 体育，体考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">68:09</a> 买一斤送半斤的鸡叉骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4133">68:53</a> 校园外卖事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4198">69:58</a> 校讯通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4313">71:53</a> 老师，体罚，补课，送礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4809">80:09</a> 数学,考试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5130">85:30</a> 学校趣闻2.0</span></p>]]></description>
