    <guid isPermaLink="false">672365a0cbe0e69c8b1e0035</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 11:19:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>会word、ppt、excel的鑫宇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>藏有秘密的大雄</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>放声大笑的春阳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>没有抢到片尾曲的雨潼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> &nbsp;招新时印象深刻的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 招新后我们对自己的反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 大雄究竟要反思什么！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 招新后我们才突然意识到的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 请关注浙传桐乐会！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 请来桐乐摆架子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 去年我们被招的趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 大雄竟然没有编制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 通过正规路径进入桐乐会的春阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 春阳印象深刻的鑫宇和天赐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 志彤的炫彩黄金大萝卜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">46:58</a> 桐乐会的婆罗门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> 似sketch又非sketch的东西是怎么来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3402">56:42</a> talk show？stand up comedy!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a> 片尾曲究竟是谁决定的！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>thebirds - 沙威玛传奇</span></p>]]></description>
